Common Seniority
    documentation "Entries of job experience contributing to computations of seniority."
    descriptor CredentialField
        documentation "The field of the credential being applied."
        is part of identity
    shared string NameOfInstitution
        documentation "The name of the education organization where a person has worked."
        is part of identity
    shared decimal NumberOfYears named YearsExperience
        documentation "The number of years of experience."
        is required
